        "description": "<p>CMS may sound like a big word. But A content management system (CMS) is computer software used to manage the creation and modification of digital content (content management). Personal-Website-CMS does just that. It provides a CMS to publish a personal website with the bare minimum features. If CMS sounds inconvenient, you may call it Micro-CMS.</p><p>This was the initial prototype to test the theory that a dynamic website, in the sense that the content it shows can be updated by the user, can be hosted using static website deployment technologies.</p>",
